[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# ── Agent instruction files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md stays local. `.claude/` does not, in full: the authorship rule is
# only a rule if it travels with the repository, so the settings that empty
# agent attribution and the hook that enforces the committer identity are
# tracked. A directory ignored with a trailing slash cannot be re-included
# file by file — git never descends into it — hence `.claude/*` and the two
# negations. Everything else under `.claude/`, settings.local.json included,
# stays ignored.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
.hypothesis/

# Workload-suite reports (tests/workloads) — regenerated, never reviewed.
artifacts/

# osmnx's Overpass response cache, written to ./cache by default. Worth keeping
# locally — a repeat fetch of the same polygon drops from ~125 s to ~0 s — but
# it is derived data; the graph that matters lives in Postgres.
cache/

# ── Delivery PDFs (generated; built at delivery time from docs/delivery/*.md)
docs/delivery/pdf/
